#### Drift Gas

The drift gas is chosen based on several requirements including working at atmospheric pressure and exhibiting small transverse and longitudinal diffusion allowing for good two-track separation. Also, the gas must allow an electron drift velocity \(v_{d}>2.0\) cm/\(\mu\)s at an electric field \(E<300\) V/cm.

Secondary electrons from a primary track may drift in the TPC as much

